# OS / editor
.DS_Store
.idea/

# Session scratch
/scratchpad/

# Safety net (Laravel subdirs also ignore these) — never commit secrets or deps
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/credentials.plist
**/vendor/
**/node_modules/

# Machine/session-local Claude permissions (only shared settings.json is committed)
**/.claude/settings.local.json

# Tool caches
**/.deptrac.cache
**/.phpunit.result.cache
**/.phpstan.cache
